       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Daily total:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. The maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day in a monitored setting, and 1,200 mg/day for over-the-counter use.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is double the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Risks at this dose:** GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, cardiovascular events, and fluid retention. Normal kidney and liver function doesn't make this dose safe.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (3,200 mg/day), the maximum for anti-inflammatory dosing\n- **400\u2013800 mg by mouth, 3 times daily** (1,200\u20132,400 mg/day), a typical range\n- **1600 mg/day total**, for example 400 mg four times daily or 800 mg twice daily\n\nTell me which dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that it's intentional and give the clinical rationale. I'd suggest checking with pharmacy first."
      }
